        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7-6-4 When it is necessary for one or more representatives designated by the Association to attend a meeting or hearing occurring during the school day, they shall be released without loss of pay for such time as is actually necessary for their attendance at such meeting or hearing, and the necessary travel time in connection therewith. The Association will notify the Office of Employee Relations of those to be released no less than three (3) days prior to the meeting or hearing.",
